From ebba0f0ee3f5157a513fb9b62a38f0137338306b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kenan Sulayman <kenan@int.mov>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:13:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(core): add masked leaf lifting pass to simplification
 orchestrator

Introduce `TryMaskedLeafLift` to collect `(var & const)` leaf atoms, lift them into temporary variables, and recursively simplify the outer expression when the combined variable count stays within `max_vars`. After simplification, substitute the original masked atoms back into the result and accept the outcome only if it reduces expression cost and passes full-width verification.
